Belief in Trump-Russia Collusion; Regarding alleged collusion between Donald Trump and Russian authorities for political gain, including influencing elections
Belief in Russian Interference in Elections; Regarding attempts by Russia to influence US elections, without asserting whether this was intended to support Trump
Increased Surveillance; the increase in state or law enforcement surveillance activities. If the main focus is on the use of AI in surveillance, categorize under 'AI-Surveillance'

(Use the exact wording. Do not rename, paraphrase, or invent targets.)
